{"units": [{"i": 0, "p": 0, "t0": 0.0, "t1": 4.41, "text": "Di sekitar Indonesia dan Papua, permukaan laut termasuk yang paling hangat di dunia.", "v0": 3.0, "v1": 7.41}, {"i": 1, "p": 0, "t0": 5.0, "t1": 10.67, "text": "Sementara itu, di lepas pantai Peru di seberang Samudra Pasifik, lautnya dingin dan udaranya kering.", "v0": 8.0, "v1": 13.67}, {"i": 2, "p": 0, "t0": 11.4, "t1": 17.68, "text": "Dua ujung samudra yang sama bisa sangat berbeda karena ada satu sirkulasi raksasa di sepanjang ekuator.", "v0": 14.4, "v1": 20.68}, {"i": 3, "p": 1, "t0": 18.43, "t1": 22.54, "text": "Di video sebelumnya, kita mengenal sel Hadley, Ferrel, dan kutub.", "v0": 21.43, "v1": 25.54}, {"i": 4, "p": 1, "t0": 23.29, "t1": 27.7, "text": "Ketiganya bergerak di sepanjang meridian, dari utara ke selatan atau sebaliknya.", "v0": 26.29, "v1": 30.7}, {"i": 5, "p": 1, "t0": 28.01, "t1": 32.92, "text": "Sirkulasi seperti ini disebut sirkulasi meridional, atau meridional circulation.", "v0": 31.01, "v1": 35.92}, {"i": 6, "p": 2, "t0": 33.53, "t1": 38.8, "text": "Ada juga sirkulasi yang bergerak di sepanjang garis lintang, dari barat ke timur atau sebaliknya.", "v0": 36.53, "v1": 41.8}, {"i": 7, "p": 2, "t0": 39.37, "t1": 43.11, "text": "Ini disebut sirkulasi zonal, atau zonal circulation.", "v0": 42.37, "v1": 46.11}, {"i": 8, "p": 2, "t0": 43.78, "t1": 50.79, "text": "Contoh terpentingnya adalah sirkulasi Walker, atau Walker circulation, di sepanjang ekuator Samudra Pasifik.", "v0": 46.78, "v1": 53.79}, {"i": 9, "p": 3, "t0": 51.34, "t1": 53.54, "text": "Begini cara kerjanya pada kondisi normal.", "v0": 54.34, "v1": 56.54}, {"i": 10, "p": 3, "t0": 54.08, "t1": 58.41, "text": "Angin pasat timur bertiup dari timur ke barat di sepanjang ekuator Pasifik.", "v0": 57.08, "v1": 61.41}, {"i": 11, "p": 3, "t0": 58.63, "t1": 66.3, "text": "Angin ini mendorong air laut permukaan yang hangat ke arah barat, sehingga air hangat menumpuk di sekitar Indonesia dan Papua.", "v0": 61.63, "v1": 69.3}, {"i": 12, "p": 3, "t0": 66.97, "t1": 70.74, "text": "Tumpukan air hangat ini disebut kolam air hangat, atau warm pool.", "v0": 69.97, "v1": 73.74}, {"i": 13, "p": 3, "t0": 71.42, "t1": 76.03, "text": "Permukaan laut di Pasifik barat bahkan sedikit lebih tinggi daripada di Pasifik timur.", "v0": 74.42, "v1": 79.03}, {"i": 14, "p": 4, "t0": 76.69, "t1": 83.22, "text": "Di Pasifik timur, karena air permukaan terdorong ke barat, air dingin dari bawah naik ke permukaan di dekat Peru.", "v0": 79.69, "v1": 86.22}, {"i": 15, "p": 4, "t0": 83.83, "t1": 86.38, "text": "Naiknya air dingin ini disebut upwelling.", "v0": 86.83, "v1": 89.38}, {"i": 16, "p": 4, "t0": 86.56, "t1": 92.46, "text": "Air dingin ini kaya nutrien, sehingga perairan Peru menjadi salah satu daerah perikanan terkaya di dunia.", "v0": 89.56, "v1": 95.46}, {"i": 17, "p": 5, "t0": 93.12, "t1": 94.48, "text": "Sekarang lihat atmosfernya.", "v0": 96.12, "v1": 97.48}, {"i": 18, "p": 5, "t0": 94.7, "t1": 101.76, "text": "Di atas kolam air hangat Indonesia, udara dipanaskan, naik kuat, dan membentuk awan serta hujan lebat.", "v0": 97.7, "v1": 104.76}, {"i": 19, "p": 5, "t0": 102.44, "t1": 104.13, "text": "Tekanan di permukaan menjadi rendah.", "v0": 105.44, "v1": 107.13}, {"i": 20, "p": 5, "t0": 104.75, "t1": 107.31, "text": "Di lapisan atas, udara mengalir ke timur.", "v0": 107.75, "v1": 110.31}, {"i": 21, "p": 5, "t0": 107.9, "t1": 113.79, "text": "Di atas Pasifik timur yang dingin, udara turun, sehingga tekanan permukaan tinggi dan cuaca kering.", "v0": 110.9, "v1": 116.79}, {"i": 22, "p": 5, "t0": 114.51, "t1": 118.39, "text": "Lalu di permukaan, udara kembali ke barat sebagai angin pasat timur.", "v0": 117.51, "v1": 121.39}, {"i": 23, "p": 5, "t0": 118.69, "t1": 120.99, "text": "Lingkaran tertutup inilah sirkulasi Walker.", "v0": 121.69, "v1": 123.99}, {"i": 24, "p": 6, "t0": 121.55, "t1": 129.41, "text": "Kekuatan sirkulasi Walker bisa dipantau dari selisih tekanan udara antara Tahiti di Pasifik tengah dan Darwin di Australia utara.", "v0": 124.55, "v1": 132.41}, {"i": 25, "p": 6, "t0": 130.08, "t1": 135.47, "text": "Selisih ini menjadi dasar indeks osilasi selatan, yang akan kita bahas di video El Nino.", "v0": 133.08, "v1": 138.47}, {"i": 26, "p": 7, "t0": 136.16, "t1": 138.56, "text": "Mengapa sirkulasi Walker penting untuk Indonesia?", "v0": 139.16, "v1": 141.56}, {"i": 27, "p": 7, "t0": 139.16, "t1": 143.25, "text": "Karena gangguan pada sirkulasi ini menimbulkan El Nino dan La Nina.", "v0": 142.16, "v1": 146.25}, {"i": 28, "p": 7, "t0": 143.93, "t1": 149.82, "text": "Saat sirkulasi Walker melemah, kolam air hangat bergeser ke timur, dan Indonesia menjadi lebih kering.", "v0": 146.93, "v1": 152.82}, {"i": 29, "p": 7, "t0": 150.18, "t1": 152.88, "text": "Saat menguat, Indonesia menjadi lebih basah.", "v0": 153.18, "v1": 155.88}, {"i": 30, "p": 7, "t0": 153.61, "t1": 161.7, "text": "Fenomena lain yang juga bergerak zonal adalah M J O, atau Madden Julian Oscillation, yang merambat dari barat ke timur.", "v0": 156.61, "v1": 164.7}, {"i": 31, "p": 8, "t0": 162.41, "t1": 164.07, "text": "Sekarang, coba kerjakan soal ini.", "v0": 165.41, "v1": 167.07}, {"i": 32, "p": 9, "t0": 164.79, "t1": 170.7, "text": "Sirkulasi Walker bergerak di sepanjang ekuator dengan arah barat dan timur, yaitu di sepanjang garis lintang.", "v0": 171.79, "v1": 177.7}, {"i": 33, "p": 9, "t0": 171.42, "t1": 173.17, "text": "Itulah ciri sirkulasi zonal.", "v0": 178.42, "v1": 180.17}, {"i": 34, "p": 9, "t0": 173.5, "t1": 174.6, "text": "Jawabannya B.", "v0": 180.5, "v1": 181.6}, {"i": 35, "p": 10, "t0": 175.1, "t1": 176.16, "text": "Ada dua jebakan.", "v0": 182.1, "v1": 183.16}, {"i": 36, "p": 10, "t0": 176.93, "t1": 181.3, "text": "Pertama, udara naik di Indonesia dan turun di Peru, bukan sebaliknya.", "v0": 183.93, "v1": 188.3}, {"i": 37, "p": 10, "t0": 181.93, "t1": 185.29, "text": "Kedua, sirkulasi Walker bukan bagian dari sel Hadley.", "v0": 188.93, "v1": 192.29}, {"i": 38, "p": 10, "t0": 185.64, "t1": 189.83, "text": "Sel Hadley bersifat meridional, sedangkan Walker bersifat zonal.", "v0": 192.64, "v1": 196.83}, {"i": 39, "p": 11, "t0": 190.52, "t1": 191.14, "text": "Ringkasnya:", "v0": 197.52, "v1": 198.14}, {"i": 40, "p": 11, "t0": 191.59, "t1": 195.35, "text": "sirkulasi Walker adalah sirkulasi zonal di ekuator Pasifik.", "v0": 198.59, "v1": 202.35}, {"i": 41, "p": 11, "t0": 195.94, "t1": 202.39, "text": "Udara naik di atas kolam air hangat Indonesia dan turun di atas laut dingin Peru, digerakkan angin pasat timur.", "v0": 202.94, "v1": 209.39}, {"i": 42, "p": 11, "t0": 203.04, "t1": 204.85, "text": "Berikutnya, kelembapan udara.", "v0": 210.04, "v1": 211.85}, {"i": 43, "p": 11, "t0": 205.53, "t1": 208.98, "text": "Latihan soalnya ada di O S N Geo titik I D.", "v0": 212.53, "v1": 215.98}], "words": [{"w": "Di", "t": 3.0, "u": 0}, {"w": "sekitar", "t": 3.15, "u": 0}, {"w": "Indonesia", "t": 3.62, "u": 0}, {"w": "dan", "t": 4.39, "u": 0}, {"w": "Papua,", "t": 4.55, "u": 0}, {"w": "permukaan", "t": 5.01, "u": 0}, {"w": "laut", "t": 5.55, "u": 0}, {"w": "termasuk", "t": 5.81, "u": 0}, {"w": "yang", "t": 6.21, "u": 0}, {"w": "paling", "t": 6.35, "u": 0}, {"w": "hangat", "t": 6.61, "u": 0}, {"w": "di", "t": 6.88, "u": 0}, {"w": "dunia.", "t": 7.01, "u": 0}, {"w": "Sementara", "t": 8.0, "u": 1}, {"w": "itu,", "t": 8.64, "u": 1}, {"w": "di", "t": 8.96, "u": 1}, {"w": "lepas", "t": 9.13, "u": 1}, {"w": "pantai", "t": 9.47, "u": 1}, {"w": "Peru", "t": 9.97, "u": 1}, {"w": "di", "t": 10.31, "u": 1}, {"w": "seberang", "t": 10.48, "u": 1}, {"w": "Samudra", "t": 10.98, "u": 1}, {"w": "Pasifik,", "t": 11.49, "u": 1}, {"w": "lautnya", "t": 11.99, "u": 1}, {"w": "dingin", "t": 12.41, "u": 1}, {"w": "dan", "t": 12.69, "u": 1}, {"w": "udaranya", "t": 12.83, "u": 1}, {"w": "kering.", "t": 13.39, "u": 1}, {"w": "Dua", "t": 14.4, "u": 2}, {"w": "ujung", "t": 14.72, "u": 2}, {"w": "samudra", "t": 15.04, "u": 2}, {"w": "yang", "t": 15.53, "u": 2}, {"w": "sama", "t": 15.69, "u": 2}, {"w"